A person forced to leave their country because of war is a blank.

64
00:03:48.589 --> 00:03:51.837
A, refugee. B, development. C, peace.

65
00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:57.722
The answer is A: refugee.

66
00:03:59.217 --> 00:04:01.286
blank it was raining, we went for a walk.

67
00:04:01.586 --> 00:04:04.601
A, However. B, Although. C, Because.

68
00:04:08.617 --> 00:04:10.396
The answer is B: Although.

69
00:04:11.883 --> 00:04:14.336
The test was hard. blank, everyone passed.

70
00:04:14.636 --> 00:04:17.569
A, Although. B, However. C, So that.

71
00:04:21.583 --> 00:04:23.351
The answer is B: However.

72
00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:27.442
When people cannot find jobs, there is blank.

73
00:04:27.742 --> 00:04:31.453
A, unemployment. B, public health. C, clean water.

74
00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.299
The answer is A: unemployment.

75
00:04:38.783 --> 00:04:42.350
According to the text, what is still a luxury in some areas?

76
00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:46.420
A, clean water. B, mobile phones. C, cars.

77
00:04:50.417 --> 00:04:52.497
The answer is A: clean water.

78
00:04:53.983 --> 00:04:58.366
